<title>USA: IPO FILING - Manchester Equipment Co Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Manchester Equipment Co Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	    Manchester Equipment Co Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			MANC.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $10-12/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered    2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company	 2.5 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by shareholders  none</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after IPO    8.7 million</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter    Ladenburg, Thalmann &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  375,000 shrs</p>
<p>Business: systems integrator of comnuter hardware, software and networking products, primarily for commercial customers. Use of Proceeds: To repay short-term debt, expand its New York metropolitan area telecommunications system and for working capital.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s, fiscal year ended July 31</p>
<p>				   1995		 1994</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $170,818	    $137,361</p>
<p>   - Net Income		1,663		  1,776</p>
